with Reilly's rebuttal about the nuclear family probably being the
strongest attractor in fitness space, and now I await Romana's
rebuttal.

I mention this for three reasons:

1. To dispose of the idea that yours truly has an opinion on every
subject, cast in concrete, and forever immutable. In areas I have no
real opinions on, I avoid posting.

2. Because I think this debate about families, fitness, traditional
vs. nontraditional, etc., is interesting, important, and Extropian.

3. And the participants are not trying to win their arguments by talk
of how "Reilly must have been a geek in high school" and "Frankly,
